  "name": "Building Blocks - OGC Building Blocks tutorial examples repository",
  "abstract": "A set of building blocks introducing capabilities, as a sequence of exercises.\n",
  "description": "Follow the instructions in the \"About section\" of each building block, starting with the [Orientation](bblock/ogc.bbr.tutorial.exercise0) exercise.\n",
